" were read in sequence. This is static inspection only; no application "
"execution or tests were run."
msgstr ""
"**Hatókör:** Három fájl a `src/cadrumo/application/modelo` alatt: "
"`workspace.py` (2,486 sor), `workspace_manifest.py` (1,001) és "
